			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add tag-filtered dev logging and improve VS Code compatibility\n\nAdd DevLog module providing LAND_DEV_LOG environment variable control for granular development logging. Tags include vfs, ipc, config, lifecycle, storage, exthost, folder, and logger.\n\nMake GlobalMementoPath thread-safe by wrapping in Arc<StandardMutex<..>> to prevent lock contention during concurrent storage operations.\n\nInitialize VS Code userdata directories at startup in AppLifecycle: User profile dirs, globalStorage, workspaceStorage, extensions, snippets, caches, log dirs, and agent directories. Create default config files (settings.json, keybindings.json, tasks.json, extensions.json, mcp.json).\n\nUpdate WindServiceHandlers: add set_userdata_base_dir() to store real Tauri app_data_dir, improve resolve_userdata_path() to map /User/... paths correctly, add logger commands (14 new handlers), nativeHost:getEnvironmentPaths command, and extension host stubs returning valid {id} and {pid} objects.\n\nReplace debug!/info! calls with dev_log! macro throughout AdvancedFeatures, StatusReporter, WindAdvancedSync, and WindServiceHandlers for cleaner production output while maintaining dev debug capability.\n\nAdd http://localhost:*/ URL pattern to capabilities.",
			"SHA": "0e8032b815187688c523625d0f539b8bb00a6c9a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-04-09T01:53:59Z",
